{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"手不知不觉握紧，越想抱牢越怕失衡\",\"source\":\"原本只是轻轻握着另一个人的手，后来不自觉地握得更紧。自己也许还没有意识到在害怕什么，动作已经先透露了出来。另一幅更晃荡的画面，是想用力抱紧对方、牢牢抓住当下；但你越用力，水面的颠簸就越剧烈，船舱内的平衡就越脆弱。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿没有明确人物害怕的是失衡，且特意保留了他可能还不知道自己在怕什么；屏幕稿把船舱平衡变脆弱的画面转成了人物明确的恐惧。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f0be6933-02e0-4d47-9c6b-34c365a82615", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T082834381079Z", "elapsed_seconds": 565.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T08:37:59.794260+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6ef47616b7ef057361b085cb11228cd37fc06c6e899ba91ac1b1187564d1393d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, 